              <div>
                <h2 style="margin:0; font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:1000; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);">🚚 Logistics Orders</h2>
                <p class="muted" style="margin-top:6px;">Customer orders, delivery addresses and status switching.</p>
              </div>
